---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const articleSchema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "Article",
  "@id": "https://shareitstudio.com/case-studies/vizayo#article",
  "headline": "Vizayo Case Study | Share It Studio",
  "description": "Elevating Vizayo’s Amazon Listing with High-Quality Product Videos",
  "author": {
    "@type": "Organization",
    "name": "Share It Studio"
  },
  "publisher": {
    "@type": "Organization",
    "name": "Share It Studio",
    // Optional: Add a logo if available
    // "logo": {
    //   "@type": "ImageObject",
    //   "url": "https://shareitstudio.com/logo.png"
    // }
  }
};

const breadcrumbListSchema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
  "@id": "https://shareitstudio.com/case-studies/vizayo#breadcrumb",
  "itemListElement": [
    {
      "@type": "ListItem",
      "position": 1,
      "name": "Home",
      "item": "https://shareitstudio.com/"
    },
    {
      "@type": "ListItem",
      "position": 2,
      "name": "Case Studies",
      "item": "https://shareitstudio.com/case-studies"
    },
    {
      "@type": "ListItem",
      "position": 3,
      "name": "vizayo Case Study",
      "item": "https://shareitstudio.com/case-studies/vizayo"
    }
  ]
};

const combinedSchema = [articleSchema, breadcrumbListSchema];
---

<Layout 
  title="Vizayo Case Study | Share It Studio" 
  description="Elevating Vizayo’s Amazon Listing with High-Quality Product Videos"
  schema={combinedSchema}
>
<article itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Article">
    <header>
      <h1 itemprop="headline">Case Study: Elevating Vizayo's Amazon Listing with High-Quality Product Videos</h1>
      <p itemprop="description">How strategic premium video production broke the 1% conversion rate ceiling and drove a 49% increase in overall CVR for Vizayo’s Tabletop Fire Pit Bowl.</p>
    </header>

    <section id="client-background">
      <h2>Client Background</h2>
      <p><strong>Vizayo</strong>, a brand in the Fire Pits niche, approached us to enhance their Amazon listing for their Tabletop Fire Pit Bowl. They were trying to compete in the premium side of fire pits, but their conversion rate was below expectations, struggling to break the 1% ceiling.</p>
    </section>

    <section id="initial-challenge">
      <h2>Initial Challenge</h2>
      <p>The primary issue was a low conversion rate, with Vizayo unable to effectively showcase the premium qualities of their product. The main goal was to exceed a 1% conversion rate for the parent ASIN.</p>

      <section id="baseline-metrics">
        <h3>Baseline Metrics (Pre-Optimization)</h3>
        <dl>
          <dt>Sessions</dt>
          <dd>13,481</dd>

          <dt>Units Ordered</dt>
          <dd>97</dd>

          <dt>Parent Conversion Rate</dt>
          <dd>0.72%</dd>
        </dl>

        <h4>Child ASIN Baseline CVR</h4>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Child ASIN 1:</strong> 0.87%</li>
          <li><strong>Child ASIN 2:</strong> 0.50%</li>
          <li><strong>Child ASIN 3:</strong> 0.91%</li>
        </ul>
      </section>
    </section>

    <section id="our-approach">
      <h2>Our Approach</h2>
      <p>We quickly identified that the key challenge was highlighting the product's premium attributes. Our strategy involved analyzing competitor reviews to understand valued features, and conducting keyword analysis to align scenes and titles with customer search intent.</p>
    </section>

    <section id="implementation">
      <h2>Implementation</h2>
      <p>Our plan focused on creating a high-quality video rather than altering existing images, as videos are excellent for showcasing premium qualities. We proposed this strategy to Vizayo, who agreed and sent their product to our video production studio.</p>

      <p>We filmed scenes emphasizing the product's use in outdoor spaces that conveyed high status and edited the video to highlight its premium aspects.</p>
    </section>

    <section id="results">
      <h2>Results</h2>
      <p>In the two months following optimization, despite a decrease in sessions (not attributed to our efforts), sales increased due to the higher conversion rate, demonstrating the effectiveness of our video strategy:</p>

      <dl>
        <dt>Sessions</dt>
        <dd>11,629</dd>

        <dt>Units Ordered</dt>
        <dd>125 <strong>(+29% increase)</strong></dd>

        <dt>Parent Conversion Rate</dt>
        <dd>1.07% <strong>(+49% increase)</strong></dd>
      </dl>

      <h3>Child ASIN Conversion Rate Results</h3>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Child ASIN 1 CVR:</strong> 1.05% <strong>(+21% increase)</strong></li>
        <li><strong>Child ASIN 2 CVR:</strong> 0.75% <strong>(+50% increase)</strong></li>
        <li><strong>Child ASIN 3 CVR:</strong> 1.88% <strong>(+107% increase)</strong></li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section id="key-takeaways">
      <h2>Key Takeaways</h2>
      <p>This project underscores the power of high-quality videos in conveying premium product qualities. By focusing on dynamic, status-enhancing visuals, brands can significantly boost conversion rates. Understanding competitor insights and customer preferences is crucial for optimizing Amazon listings effectively.</p>
    </section>

    <section id="call-to-action">
      <h2>Call to Action</h2>
      <p>At <strong>Share It Studio</strong>, we excel in transforming Amazon listings into powerful sales drivers. Our data-driven, marketing-first approach has led to a 77% average sales increase for our clients.</p>

      <p>Ready to elevate your Amazon listings and boost your sales? Book a call with us today and see the results for yourself!</p>
    </section>
  </article>
</Layout>